# Part of sys-bike: Route 207, the bike slope at x 306 (bottom 719, top 718). From a standstill right
# below it, gear 1 never reaches speed 3: each try slides back to (306, 720) (decomp
# PlayerAvatar_TileMove_BikeSlope).
player cycle 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_207 306 720 up
until idle
+0 assert state cyclingGear 1
+0 press up
+60 release up
+20 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_207 306 720
